  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Responses to Address Regional Instability in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action&#xbf;s overall objective is to further Crisis Group&#xbf;s conflict-prevention mission by supporting the EU with granular analysis and policy recommendations based on in-country research to inform its strategic decisions and improve its project design and implementation processes to address insecurity in Africa. The specific objective of the Action is to enhance knowledge on the part of the EU on the drivers of instability, insecurity and forced displacement in sub-Saharan Africa as well as the identification of approaches and policies to better address them.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
